<title>PHILIPPINES: Solid Group 1996 net at 839 mln pesos.</title>
<headline>Solid Group 1996 net at 839 mln pesos.</headline>
<dateline>MANILA 1997-01-22</dateline>
<text>
<p>Solid Group Inc reported on Wednesday an unaudited 1996 net income of 839 million pesos.</p>
<p>In its disclosure to the Securities and Exchange Commission, Solid Group said gross sales for 1996 amounted to 7.4 billion pesos, a 54 percent increase from 4.8 billion pesos in 1995.</p>
<p>Comparative 1995 figures were not disclosed.</p>
</text>
